# ============================================================
# 统一换行符：仓库内一律以 LF 存储与检出
# 避免 shell 脚本在 Linux/Docker 中因 CRLF 报 "bad interpreter"
# ============================================================
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本必须保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# ============================================================
# 二进制文件不做换行转换
# ============================================================
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.jar binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary